  "configuration_id": "config_001",
  "reason": "Evidence: Multiprofile is clearly superior to singleprofile (0.715–0.721 vs 0.532), and among multiprofile multimodal configs with scvi_n200 + imagenet_vit_l, transformer aggregation (config_032, acc=0.721) edges out avgpool (config_031, acc=0.715), though the gap is small and F1 slightly favors avgpool. The fusion method (concat vs weighted) is the primary untested dimension within this best-performing backbone. This experiment tests whether weighted fusion can improve over concat with the transformer-aggregated, multiprofile, scvi_n200 + imagenet_vit_l setup—a direct logical extension of the current best. If weighted fusion helps, it could push accuracy above 0.721; if not, it confirms concat is sufficient and redirects effort toward encoder choices. Expected cost is comparable to config_032 (~4.7 GPU hrs), since weighted fusion adds only a small parameter overhead over concat with the same transformer aggregation."
}

